TUI-TC-003	Toggle password visibility	App is launched and the password field is available.	1. Enter a password from test data. 2. Toggle password visibility. 3. Verify the control responds correctly.	Password visibility toggles as expected.	Pass
TUI-TC-004	Successful login displays search results and hotel details	Valid login test data is available.	1. Launch the app. 2. Enter valid login details. 3. Submit the form. 4. Verify search results, navigation tabs, and first hotel details.	Search results screen, navigation tabs, and first hotel details are displayed.	Pass
